// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Bane_Spider_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2592200944" "Taken from the ranks of the Wolf Spiders, Bane Spider Commandos are given specialized assault training. They are vicious masters of combat that relish engaging the enemies of Arachnos."
// DisplayNames :
"P3053709498" "Bane Spider Commando"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Bane_Spider_Lt_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1572701993" "Taken from the ranks of the Wolf Spiders, Bane Spider Scouts are given specialized covert operations training. They are elite spies used by Lord Recluse to monitor activities both on the Rogue Isles and beyond."
// DisplayNames :
"P2928736564" "Bane Spider Scout"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Bane_Spider_Lt_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Bane_Spider_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P506846928" "Only the most trusted Arachnos agents are allowed to lead the Bane Spiders. An agent must be ruthless and efficient to become one of Lord Recluse's personal guardsmen. It is a great honor to be promoted to the position of a Bane Spider Executioner."
// DisplayNames :
"P2520211085" "Bane Spider Executioner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mako 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1321586758" "Gideon Ray is a savage mutant who has evolved into what can only be described as a humanoid shark. His acts are even more terrible than his appearance, and few foes are even identifiable once Mako is through with them. Mako is responsible for the death of Sharkhead Isle's most famous hero, Scrapyard."
// DisplayNames :
"P2085354169" "Captain Mako"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Scirocco 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3446589056" "Imad Malak was not always an evil man. Evil came to him from without. He was traveling in the deep desert near the Baka Valley deep in the Middle East. There he discovered an ancient tomb and stumbled inside. The tomb was that of a long-dead desert hero, and contained several objects of power including the bottle of the djinn Serafina. Also within was the hero's scimitar that granted the wielder incredible powers. Malak took the sword and donned the mantle of Scirocco. Unfortunately he fell under a curse and was driven to commit acts of great evil. He sold the other objects off to the highest bidder, the bottle ending up with the Circle of Thorns. Once a hero of the people, he is now a dark stain on their proud heritage. Imad wishes nothing more than to find some way to rid himself of the curse and find redemption."
// DisplayNames :
"P305481352" "Scirocco"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Black_Scorpion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2224577920" "Ernesto Rodriguez embodies the concept of raw power through technology. Whatever it takes, whatever piece of his body or soul needs to be spliced, altered, or removed to grant him more power, Ernesto seems willing to do it. His unbridled hunger, absolute loyalty, and low intelligence makes him the perfect servant for Lord Recluse."
// DisplayNames :
"P1258505021" "Black Scorpion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Lord_Recluse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2936484795" "The Master of Evil, the Count of Cruel, the Archvillain of Anarchy. Lord Recluse has been called many things. But the people of the Rogue Isles know him as their lord and ruler. Lord Recluse has a mysterious tie with Paragon City's own Statesman - some even claim they were once close companions. Their hatred for one another certainly belies a secret perhaps best left buried."
// DisplayNames :
"P2939457459" "Lord Recluse"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

