"P4042339853" "St. Martial is infested with these horrid demons. A rumor on a Johnnie 'The Pipes' Sonata fan-site a few weeks back 'joked' that the singer must have sold his soul for his golden voice and the demons are here to collect. Maybe there's some truth to it."
// GroupDescription :
"P3346905862" "Wailers"
// DisplayNames :
"P1956079446" "Wailer Queen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Pets_Hero_Clone_Power_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4011187968" "No one knows who these helmet clad heroes are,or where they come from. The only thing that's certain is their loyalty to Crey. The Power Paragon Protectors can generate powerful blasts of energy in both melee and ranged combat situations."
// GroupDescription :
"P2697745710" "Paragon Protectors"
// DisplayNames :
"P3386713781" "Paragon Protector"

